    "section": "Kinetic Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Kinetic Lightweight Combat Bow\n\n[ADS] while fully-drawn grants Truesight, displaying enemy silhouettes through walls up to 64 metres away.\nTruesight lasts until no longer ADS, or after 3 seconds of being active. Must fully redraw to reactivate the perk.\n\nArrows deal a total of 1,164 [159] damage split into 3 [2] different damage instances.\nThe initial arrow impact deals up to 276 [129] damage with a 1.79x Precision Multiplier.\nThe two [one] instances from Broadhead deal up to 444 [28.75] damage and are not affected by Precision Hits.\nDraw Strength affects the damage of all damage instances.\n\n25% Increased damage against Combatants stuck by Witherhoard's Blight. \n10% Increased damage against Taken Combatants.\n\n↑Catalyst: Grants the One For All trait.",
